    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Michael Pigott Auctioneer & Valuer proudly beings to the market for sale this wonderful three bedroom semi-detached property situated in the hugely popular and sought after Forest Hill development in Carrigaline.\r\n\r\nThis property has the benefit of occupying a nice quiet cul de sac position within the park and also has a direct south facing garden to the rear which  features lovely patio areas for one to sit out and enjoy lots of privacy. The house itself is equally impressive having been superbly finished and well cared for by its current owners. It is completed to the highest of standards with excellent quality fixtures & fittings evident throughout and is beautifully decorated with nice bright natural decor. It includes many features such as modern fitted kitchen with integrated appliances, luxury tile flooring, multi-fuel stove in the living room and fully tiled bathrooms just to name a few. \r\n\r\nThe property is most conveniently located just minutes to all amenities and services in Carrigaline and is only a very short commute to Cork City Centre, Cork Airport & Ringaskiddy. It also has very easy access to a regular public bus service available close by and is just a short drive to a selection of local beaches such as Fountainstown & Myrtleville. \r\n\r\nViewing of this immaculate home in turnkey condition comes highly recommended to see what a gem this is."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 5.4m x 2.0m \r\nCeramic tile floor, solid wooden staircase with carpet centre, under stair pull out storage drawers, decorative cornicing, centre light, telephone point, composite front door with glazed side panel.\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 4.82m x 3.42m \r\nWooden floor, inserted multi fuel stove with cast iron and marble surround, decorative cornicing, tv and telephone points, bay window, window blind, centre light\r\n\r\nUtility Room - 3.16m x 1.36m \r\nCeramic tile floor, extensive fitted units, plumbed for washing machine and tumble dryer, stainless steel vanity unit with quartz worktop, centre light, side door.\r\n\r\nGuest WC - 1.6m x 1.65m \r\nCeramic tile floor, wc with overhead shelf storage, whb with tile surround, centre globe light\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining - 5.84m x 3.0m \r\nCeramic tile floor, extensive and modern fitted kitchen unit with integrated: fridge/freezer, dishwasher, oven, grill, microwave, gas hob and overhead extractor unit. Tile splashback, quartz worktop, breakfast bar, window blind, door to rear garden with side window, window and door blinds, decorative coving, centre spotlights/centre down lights\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR - \r\n\r\n\r\nLanding - \r\nWooden floor, hot press with built in shelving, stira stairs leading to floored attic.\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom - 3.5m x 2.89m \r\nWooden floor, large built in slide robe unit, built in dressing area and cupboard, window blind, curtain pole and curtain, centre light, tv and telephone points\r\n\r\nEn-Suite - 2.97m x 0.95m \r\nFully tiled wall and floor, power shower unit with chrome enclosure, wc, whb with underneath storage, centre globe light\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.88m x 3.01m \r\nWooden floor, large built in sliderobe unit, window blind, centre light.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 2.9m x 2.72m \r\nWooden floor, window blind, centre light\r\n\r\nBathroom - 1.85m x 2.12m \r\nFully tiled wall and floor, electric shower unit with chrome enclosure, wc, whb, centre globe light, wall shaver light.\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Size: c. 105 sq metres (1,130 sq ft)\r\nGas Fired Zoned Central Heating \r\nPV panels for electricity & hot water\r\nPVC Double Glazed Windows & Doors\r\nA3 Rated Modern Semi-Detached\r\nStira stairs leading to floored attic\r\nSuperb condition throughout\r\nExtensive modern fitted kitchen with integrated appliances\r\nBeautiful rear garden with  patio areas\r\nSteeltech shed fully insulated & electricity\r\nQuiet cul de sac position\r\nCobble lock driveway with parking for two cars\r\nHugely popular residential location\r\n24 hour bus access in the estate\r\nClose to all amenities & services in Carrigaline\r\nShort drive to a selection of local beaches \r\nShort commute to Cork City Centre, Cork Airport & Ringaskiddy"
      },
